KG42.register("rules-a49d42b01badae1bfd454b3c",{"id":"48-multiple_energy_carrier_market::v141-c-R006","paper":"48-multiple_energy_carrier_market","record":{"rule_id":"v141-c-R006","mechanism_id":"v141-a-M01","name":"Prosumer participation","process_stage":"participation","market_meaning":"A solar PV system or a building with solar PV and energy storage can constitute a market participant. Scope: The expressly identified participation examples of a solar PV system and a building with solar PV and energy storage in the proposed local market. Condition: It must be possible to meter the chosen market participant independently.","independence_rationale":"Relations governed by the approved function participation.prosumer under the fixed relation-ownership template. Conditional branches retain their explicit scope in local constraints.","V":["participation.prosumer"],"E":[],"omega":{"market_type":"LEM","network_level":null,"jurisdiction":null,"pricing_scope":null,"time_scale":null,"participant_types":[],"trading_stage":"participation","context_text":"The expressly identified participation examples of a solar PV system and a building with solar PV and energy storage in the proposed local market.","unknown_fields":["network_level","jurisdiction","pricing_scope","time_scale","participant_types"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E003"]},"x":[],"theta":[],"phi":[{"constraint_id":"v141-c-R006-C001","kind":"procedural","role":"core","statement":"A solar PV system or a building with solar PV and energy storage can constitute a market participant. Scope: The expressly identified participation examples of a solar PV system and a building with solar PV and energy storage in the proposed local market. Condition: It must be possible to meter the chosen market participant independently.","expression":null,"formalization_origin":"not_formalized","template_id":null,"members":["participation.prosumer"],"variable_refs":[],"parameter_refs":[],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E003"]}],"pi":[{"evidence_id":"v141-b-g01-E003","location":{"location_id":"src-ec182c21f1-p03-c1r3__v141-a-M01-participation","page":3,"printed_page":null,"section":null,"anchor_text":"3. Market actors, roles and responsibilities 4. Before describing the market design, we here provide","equation_id":null,"figure_id":null,"table_id":null,"image_ref":"pages/page-03.png","occurrence_role":"definition"},"source_text":"The term market participant is used to refer to a physical asset, or group of assets, participating in the market as a single unit. For example, a market participant could be a building, a solar PV system, an energy storage facility, or a building with solar PV and energy storage. The delineation between different market participants can be determined by the asset owner, but it is constrained by the availability of meter data - it must be possible to meter each market participant independently."}],"field_notes":{"empty_E_reason":"C explicitly supplied only source-backed unary facts for this function; other graph gaps remain reviewable.","empty_x_reason":"The source evidence v141-b-g01-E003 states a qualitative participant definition and an independent-metering admissibility condition. It contains no design-selection or operational decision variable, so x is empty because the rule is procedural/admission rather than an optimization or dispatch rule.","empty_theta_reason":"The same evidence defines no fixed numeric or symbolic input or constant for this participation rule. Independent metering is a qualitative condition, so theta is empty for this procedural rule."},"evidence_basis":"explicit","implementation_status":"unimplemented","status":"needs_review","lead_ids":["v141-a-M01-participation"],"extras":{"decision_anchor":"participation.prosumer","graph_fact_supports":[[{"evidence_id":"v141-b-g01-E003","quote":"For example, a market participant could be a building, a solar PV system, an energy storage facility, or a building with solar PV and energy storage."},{"evidence_id":"v141-b-g01-E003","quote":"The delineation between different market participants can be determined by the asset owner, but it is constrained by the availability of meter data - it must be possible to meter each market participant independently."}]],"C2_formalization":{"graph_sha256":"a3b48a38e60af5021e780bc000a1f34b76f61ee67633325a7c822279cf7254ff","applicability":"non_mathematical","reason":"This is a procedural participation/admission rule. The supplied evidence defines a market participant qualitatively as a physical asset or group of assets participating as one unit, gives solar PV and a building with PV plus storage as examples, and imposes the condition that the chosen participant can be metered independently. It contains no algebraic variables, fixed numerical or symbolic parameters, or mathematical constraint relation. The evidence remains unreviewed, and this formalization makes no source-correctness claim.","bindings":[{"object_id":"v141-c-R006-C001","node_ids":["participation.prosumer"],"edge_ids":[],"rationale":"The procedural participation constraint is attached to the sole frozen node, participation.prosumer. The supplied source text identifies which physical assets can constitute a market participant and requires independent metering, but it provides no mathematical expression or decision variable. The rule has no frozen edges, so no edge binding is asserted."}],"revision_requests":[]}},"quarantined_references":[]}});
